<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Metzler Group said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Metzler Group said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson Lufkin &amp; Jenrette Securities has cut its rating of Metzler Group Inc to a market perform from a buy, according to a market source.</p>
<p>-- Metzler Group shares fell 1/8 to 26-1/8 in early trading on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- The stock hit a new high of 26-3/4 in early trading.</p>
<p>-- The company went public in October at $16 a share. DLJ was the lead underwriter of the IPO.</p>
</text>
